link: Nx / s1ngularity | breaches/nx-s1ngularity.html
link: Mini Shai-Hulud / TanStack | breaches/mini-shai-hulud-tanstack.html
link: npm debug / chalk | breaches/npm-debug-chalk-phishing.html
